      "message": "test: handle mainnet logs in combine_logs.py\n\nMainnet functional tests write debug.log directly under node0/.\nThe helper used to skip that log, but since #16973, the recursive glob finds it, but the regex still expects a chain subdirectory and raises AttributeError.\n\nDerive the relative directory from the discovered path so the helper can include the mainnet node log in its output.\n\nGithub-Pull: #36982\nRebased-From: 4e1dc2e01511ef9328a54fbbf756cb8c159898a7",
